          }}>Technology</div>
          <h2 style={{ 
            fontSize: 'clamp(3rem, 5vw, 5rem)', 
            fontWeight: 100, 
            color: '#fff',
            letterSpacing: '-0.03em',
            marginBottom: '2vh',
            lineHeight: 1.1
          }}>
            Built with excellence
