        </div>

        {/* Infrastructure Grid */}
        <div style={{
          display: 'grid',
          gridTemplateColumns: '1.2fr 0.8fr',
          gap: '4vw',
          marginBottom: '10vh',
          alignItems: 'center'
        }}>
          {/* Left Content */}
          <div>
            <h3 style={{ 
              fontSize: 'clamp(2rem, 3vw, 3rem)', 
              fontWeight: 300, 
              color: '#fff', 
              marginBottom: '4vh',
              letterSpacing: '-0.02em'
            }}>
              High-end Infrastructure
            </h3>
            
            {[
              'Our distributed centerfield will ensure high-end responses in this space. Each data center is optimized to deliver maximum performance.',
              'With advanced DY processing, and 10 databases hosted by azure, everything always take the most optimal route. We use edge tech to reduce the distance between users and us.',
              'The infrastructure is designed to scale automatically based on demand, ensuring you never experience service degradation.',
              'Our redundancy system guarantees that even if a data center fails, you are automatically redirected without you noticing any interruption.'
            ].map((text, i) => (
              <div key={i} style={{
                padding: '2.5vh 0',
                borderBottom: i < 3 ? '1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.06)' : 'none',
                transition: 'all 0.3s ease',
                cursor: 'pointer'
              }}
              onMouseEnter={(e) => {
                e.currentTarget.style.paddingLeft = '2vw';
                e.currentTarget.style.borderColor = 'rgba(255,255,255,0.15)';
              }}
              onMouseLeave={(e) => {
                e.currentTarget.style.paddingLeft = '0';
                e.currentTarget.style.borderColor = 'rgba(255,255,255,0.06)';
              }}>
                <p style={{ 
                  fontSize: 'clamp(0.95rem, 1.05vw, 1.1rem)', 
                  color: 'rgba(255,255,255,0.6)', 
                  lineHeight: 1.7,
                  margin: 0
                }}>{text}</p>
              </div>
            ))}
          </div>

          {/* Right Grid */}
          <div style={{
            display: 'grid',
            gridTemplateColumns: '1fr 1fr',
            gap: '1.5vw'
          }}>
            {[
              { title: 'Edge Computing', icon: <svg width="40" height="40" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" strokeWidth="1.5"><path d="M21 16V8a2 2 0 0 0-1-1.73l-7-4a2 2 0 0 0-2 0l-7 4A2 2 0 0 0 3 8v8a2 2 0 0 0 1 1.73l7 4a2 2 0 0 0 2 0l7-4A2 2 0 0 0 21 16z"/><polyline points="7.5 4.21 12 6.81 16.5 4.21"/><polyline points="7.5 19.79 7.5 14.6 3 12"/><polyline points="21 12 16.5 14.6 16.5 19.79"/><polyline points="3.27 6.96 12 12.01 20.73 6.96"/><line x1="12" y1="22.08" x2="12" y2="12"/></svg> },
              { title: 'Global CDN', icon: <svg width="40" height="40" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" strokeWidth="1.5"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><line x1="2" y1="12" x2="22" y2="12"/><path d="M12 2a15.3 15.3 0 0 1 4 10 15.3 15.3 0 0 1-4 10 15.3 15.3 0 0 1-4-10 15.3 15.3 0 0 1 4-10z"/></svg> },
              { title: 'Simultaneous', icon: <svg width="40" height="40" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" strokeWidth="1.5"><polyline points="23 6 13.5 15.5 8.5 10.5 1 18"/><polyline points="17 6 23 6 23 12"/></svg> },
              { title: 'Unheard Insights', icon: <svg width="40" height="40" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" strokeWidth="1.5"><path d="M1 12s4-8 11-8 11 8 11 8-4 8-11 8-11-8-11-8z"/><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="3"/></svg> }
            ].map((item, i) => (
              <div key={i} style={{
                aspectRatio: '1',
                background: 'linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.03) 0%, rgba(255,255,255,0.01) 100%)',
                borderRadius: '20px',
                border: '1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08)',
                display: 'flex',
                flexDirection: 'column',
                alignItems: 'center',
                justifyContent: 'center',
                textAlign: 'center',
                padding: '2vw',
                transition: 'all 0.4s cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1)',
                cursor: 'pointer',
                position: 'relative',
                overflow: 'hidden'
              }}
              onMouseEnter={(e) => {
                e.currentTarget.style.background = 'linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.08) 0%, rgba(255,255,255,0.03) 100%)';
                e.currentTarget.style.transform = 'translateY(-10px)';
                e.currentTarget.style.borderColor = 'rgba(255,255,255,0.2)';
              }}
              onMouseLeave={(e) => {
                e.currentTarget.style.background = 'linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.03) 0%, rgba(255,255,255,0.01) 100%)';
                e.currentTarget.style.transform = 'translateY(0)';
                e.currentTarget.style.borderColor = 'rgba(255,255,255,0.08)';
              }}>
                <div style={{ color: 'rgba(255,255,255,0.4)', marginBottom: '2vh' }}>{item.icon}</div>
                <div style={{ 
                  fontSize: 'clamp(0.9rem, 1vw, 1.05rem)', 
                  fontWeight: 600, 
                  color: '#fff',
                  letterSpacing: '-0.01em'
                }}>{item.title}</div>
              </div>
            ))}
          </div>
        </div>

        {/* What's Coming - Immersive */}
        <div style={{
